  ('Bachelor of Accountancy (Honours)', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Infrastructure University Kuala Lumpur (IUKL)' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 4689, '3.5 years', '["Mar","Jun","Oct"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor of Accountancy (Honours) Progarm at Infrastructure University Kuala Lumpur (IUKL) University Malaysia prepares students to become competent and dedicated professional accountants. The program covers various areas of accounting, including taxation, auditing, finance, and management accounting. Through a well-balanced curriculum and industrial placements, students gain both theoretical knowledge and practical experience. Studying this course offers a wide range of job opportunities and equips graduates with valuable financial management skills for personal use.

