  ('Bachelor of Arts (Hons) in English for Professional Communication', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Infrastructure University Kuala Lumpur (IUKL)' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 3960, '3 years', '["Mar","Jun","Oct"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor of Arts (Hons) in English for Professional Communication Program at Infrastructure University Kuala Lumpur (IUKL) University Malaysia focuses on developing effective communication skills in professional settings. Students will enhance their English language proficiency in writing, reading, listening, and speaking, with an emphasis on corporate communication. The program also includes training on office applications and emphasizes the development of oral communication skills. Students will gain both academic and soft skills, preparing them for their professional careers through workplace-related tasks and professional development opportunities.

