  ('Aircraft Maintenance License Program – EASA Part 66', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UniKL University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 11440, '2 years', '["Mar","Jul"]'::jsonb, 'The Aircraft Maintenance License Program – EASA Part 66 at Universiti Kuala Lumpur Malaysian Institute of Aviation Technology (UniKL MIAT) is a prestigious training initiative in collaboration with AERO-Bildungs GmbH of Germany. Recognized by the European Aviation Safety Agency (EASA) as an approved Aviation Maintenance Training Organization (MTO) in Malaysia, this program prepares students for a career in aircraft maintenance.

