  ('Bachelor of Marine Engineering Technology with Honours', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UniKL University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 4382, '4 years', '["Jan","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor of Marine Engineering Technology with Honours at UniKL University Malaysia responds to the rapid development of the marine industry, which encompasses a wide range of areas, including vessel types, offshore platform design, construction, operation, maintenance, and the production of spare parts and shipping equipment. With over 22,000 professionals engaged in the local marine sector, there is an expected annual increase in human resource needs of 8% to 10%. In light of this demand, UniKL MIMET aims to offer Marine Engineering Technology courses to cultivate semi-professional bodies that contribute to the industry''s growth and the nation’s development.

The program is designed for STPM holders and provides training to prepare students for professional roles in the marine industry, fostering individual development and contributing to overall economic growth. In addition to engineering technology subjects, the curriculum includes skills in technopreneurship, design innovation, and project management, ensuring that graduates become highly skilled technical workers who are creative, innovative, and capable of managing, operating, and maintaining systems related to marine industries.

For other qualifications and certificates (e.g., UEC, Foundation, STAM, etc..) please contact our educational consultants or submit your application for Admission assessment.

***For local Muslim students only****For local non-Muslim and international students only

