  ('Bachelor of Occupational Safety & Health', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UniKL University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 4576, '4 years', '["Jan","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor of Occupational Safety & Health (Honours) program at UniKL University Malaysia aims to produce knowledgeable and competent graduates who are effective leaders with strong teamwork and communication skills. The program emphasizes lifelong learning, professionalism, ethics, and social responsibility. Graduates are equipped with technical expertise in occupational safety & health and possess the ability to assess, analyze, and provide solutions for workplace safety issues. They can effectively collaborate in diverse teams, communicate information, and adhere to professional and ethical standards. Graduates also possess business management and technopreneurial skills, and they strive for continuous improvement in their knowledge and skills.

