  ('Doctor Of Business Administration', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'HELP University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'PhD', 4033, '3 years', '["Jan","Feb","Mar","Apr","May","Jun","Jul","Aug","Sep","Oct","Nov","Dec"]'::jsonb, 'The Doctor of Business Administration (DBA) degree at Help University Malaysia seeks to prepare discerning individuals who are committed to personal, professional and organisational growth. It is offered through a blend of taught subjects, workshops/seminars and supervised research. It is designed to make a contribution to the enhancement of trans-disciplinary professional practice in business management disciplines, in addition to a contribution to knowledge via the development and application of theoretical frameworks, methods, and techniques within the context of practice to address real-world business issues.

