  ('BSc in Finance, Accounting and Management', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Nottingham University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 10868, '3 years', '["Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The BSc in Finance, Accounting and Management (Hons) program at Nottingham University Business School offers a highly sought-after qualification. The program integrates finance and accounting with other disciplines to provide a comprehensive understanding of running a corporation. Students learn theoretical and practical techniques in finance and accounting within an economic, organizational, and decision-making framework. The program emphasizes critical thinking and provides access to the NUBS Financial Trading Room and financial databases. Optional modules allow students to tailor their studies to their interests and career goals. Graduates are well-prepared for professional examinations in accounting and have the flexibility to pursue various career pathways. Studying abroad at the UK or China campuses, as well as partner institutions, provides additional global perspectives.

