  ('Bachelor in Mathematics and Management', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Nottingham University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 10670, '3 years', '["Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor in Mathematics and Management (Hons) program at Nottingham University Malaysia combines mathematics, probability and statistics with business management and entrepreneurship. The course structure includes core modules in mathematics and management in the first year, followed by an equal emphasis on both disciplines in the second and third years. Students can choose from a variety of optional modules to tailor the course to their interests.

