  ('Bachelor International Communication Studies with Film and Television Studies', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Nottingham University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 9504, '3 years', '["Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor International Communication Studies with Film and Television Studies (Hons) program at Nottingham University Malaysia offers hands-on learning in the techniques, strategies, and theories behind global film and television. Modules cover analysis, history, and cultural-political context, with practical assessments in scene creation and documentary production. Students gain a deep understanding of media in theory and practice, preparing them for careers in advertising, content creation, and film/TV production. State-of-the-art facilities and workshops provide a comprehensive post-production environment for filmmaking, audio, and podcasting.

For other qualifications and certificates (e.g., UEC, Foundation, STAM, etc..) please contact our educational consultants or submit your application for Admission assessment.

