  ('Bachelor TESOL in Education', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Nottingham University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 7832, '3 years', '["Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor TESOL in Education (Hons) program at Nottingham University Malaysia is specifically designed to prepare educators for teaching and interacting with students of various ages who do not have English as their first language. This three-year program combines theoretical knowledge and pedagogical content to develop a strong understanding of English language components, enabling effective teaching and communication with students and children.

For other qualifications and certificates (e.g., UEC, Foundation, STAM, etc..) please contact our educational consultants or submit your application for Admission assessment.

Thank you  for submitting your form to us. We will contact you as soon as possible to assist you on your university journey.', '[]'::jsonb, '{"min_gpa":"2.0","ielts":"5.5"}'::jsonb, '["English Language Teacher (Primary and Secondary School)\nEnglish Tutor.\nLanguage assessment specialists.\nCurriculum developers.\nInstructional designer.\nAdvertising / Digital Copywriter.\nGuidance Counsellor.\nEnglish Course Materials Developer"]'::jsonb, 'Free', 'STPM

