  ('Biotechnology MSc', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Nottingham University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 11689, '1 year', '["Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The MSc in Biotechnology is a postgraduate taught program designed to tackle global challenges related to food security, reduce hunger, enhance bioproduction and bioprocesses for industrial applications, and promote novel drug discovery and therapeutic biotechnology. Students are required to attend all lectures and formal teaching sessions as scheduled. All lecture materials will be accessible online through Moodle, providing students with unlimited access to program content both on and off campus.

