  ('BSc in Software Engineering', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Nottingham University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 10780, '3 years', '["Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Software Engineering degree at the University of Nottingham Malaysia offers an in-depth exploration of how to analyze and solve problems related to computer applications through the creation of software solutions. While it shares common modules with our computer science degrees, this program is specifically tailored to emphasize the design and implementation of large software systems, particularly those featuring interactive or multimedia components.

