  ('Business and Management MPhil', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Nottingham University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 10098, '1 year', '["Feb","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'We provide high-quality doctoral training for postgraduate students seeking to pursue a PhD. You will be assigned at least two academic supervisors who will guide you in defining your research topic, structuring and organizing your thesis, and directing your research efforts. To facilitate your transition to independent research and help you develop the necessary skills, you will complete several assessed taught modules during your first year of full-time study, while part-time students typically complete this within two years.

