  ('Education MA', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Nottingham University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 12914, '1 year', '["Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The MA/PG Diploma/PG Certificate in Education are distinctive modular and flexible programs tailored to meet the needs of individuals or organizational groups. Each module focuses on specific aspects while collectively addressing contemporary educational issues within the context of economic and social factors, relevant literature, and the shared experiences of participants.

