  ('Engineering PhD', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Nottingham University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'PhD', 11975, '3 years', '["Feb","Apr","Jun","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The core of a PhD is research, which involves extending knowledge through exploration, investigation, and contemplation. In scientific and engineering disciplines, research often includes experimentation, but it encompasses more than just experiments; it requires interpretation and deep understanding. To earn a PhD, you must develop new abstractions, approaches, algorithms, principles, or mechanisms, and your work should meet high-quality standards comparable to that of peers in your field.

To complete a PhD, you will present your research findings in a formal document known as a thesis or dissertation, which must contain a significant original contribution to knowledge or understanding. You will also need to defend your work in an oral examination called a viva voce. A full-time PhD program is typically completed in three years.

For other qualifications and certificates please contact our educational consultants or submit your application for Admission assessment.

The Faculty of Engineering offers the opportunity to study for full-time and part-time MPhil and PhD degrees across each of our departments:

Thank you  for submitting your form to us. We will contact you as soon as possible to assist you on your university journey.', '[]'::jsonb, '{"min_gpa":"2.0","ielts":"5.5"}'::jsonb, '["professors, lecturers, or researchers in universities and colleges."]'::jsonb, 'Free', 'A master’s degree (or international equivalent) with an average mark of 60% and above plus, an upper second class honours degree (or international equivalent) in a relevant discipline. Non-UK qualifications will be assessed against this standard.

For other qualifications and certificates please contact our educational consultants or submit your application for Admission assessment.'),
  ('English Language and Literature MA', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'Nottingham University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 10318, '1 year', '["Sep"]'::jsonb, 'UNM’s MA in English Language and Literature offers you the opportunity for advanced study in contemporary literary studies and applied linguistics.

