The School of English offers a range of research opportunities across various topics within English studies and leverages the resources of Nottingham’s esteemed Centre for Research in Applied Linguistics. This interdisciplinary research center is dedicated to describing and understanding language as it is acquired and used in real-world contexts.

For other qualifications and certificates please contact our educational consultants or submit your application for Admission assessment.

Teaching, broadcasting, publishing, literary criticism, advertising, marketing, publishing, journalism, communications, business, banking, law, human resources, and public relations .

