  ('Master of Communications and Media Studies', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'MONASH University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 10173, '1.5 years', '["Feb"]'::jsonb, 'A Master of Communications and Media Studies program explores the theories, practices, and impact of media and communication in society. It covers topics like media theory, digital media, journalism, public relations, advertising, film studies, and cultural studies. Students develop advanced skills in critical thinking, research, analysis, and communication, studying how media shapes our world and affects individuals and communities. Graduates can pursue careers in journalism, public relations, advertising, digital media production, and media management.

