  ('Bachelor of Accounting with Honours', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UTM University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 2654, '4 years', '["Feb","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor of Accounting with Honours program at UTM University Malaysia is available in both full-time and part-time modes. The full-time program spans eight regular semesters, while the part-time program takes twelve regular semesters to complete. Students undergo a six-month industrial training during the eighth semester in the full-time mode. Assessment includes both coursework and final examinations, with the final examination carrying a maximum weightage of 60%. Graduates can pursue careers in accounting, finance, auditing, taxation, and related fields.

