  ('Bachelor of Management with Honours', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UTM University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Bachelor', 4752, '4 years', '["Feb","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Bachelor of Management with Honours program at UTM University Malaysia is offered in both full-time and part-time modes. The academic year consists of three semesters for the first and second years, and two semesters for the third year. Students choose between operation or innovation concentrations in the second year and can select elective courses from other concentrations. Assessment is based on formative and summative evaluations throughout each semester. The eighth semester is dedicated to industrial training.

