  ('Doctor of Philosophy in Policy Studies', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UTM University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'PhD', 3564, '3 years', '["Feb","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Doctor of Philosophy in Policy Studies (Research) at UTM University Malaysia is a multidisciplinary program designed for individuals seeking to enhance their knowledge and skills as policy professionals, emphasizing the importance of evidence in policy development.

