  ('Doctor of Philosophy in Software Engineering', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UTM University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'PhD', 3564, '3 years', '["Feb","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Doctor of Philosophy in Software Engineering (Research) at UTM University Malaysia is a full-time program available exclusively at the UTM Main Campus in Johor Bahru. The duration of the program varies based on the student''s entry qualifications, lasting between three (3) to eight (8) years.

