  ('Doctor of Professional Practice - Online Degree', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UTM University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'PhD', 6321, '3 years', '["Feb","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Doctor of Professional Practice at UTM University Malaysia is a pioneering program in Malaysia, collaboratively developed by eight faculties in engineering, science, and technology. This innovative program integrates coursework with research, requiring candidates to complete eight advanced courses alongside a capstone project.

