  ('Engineering Doctorate', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UTM University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'PhD', 4224, '3 years', '["Feb","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Engineering Doctorate (Eng.Doc) program at Universiti Teknologi Malaysia is a unique doctoral program that integrates industrial-focused research to address real-life work-based challenges. This mixed-mode program combines engineering research with training in business and management skills to develop innovative solutions for technological products or processes. Graduates of the Eng.Doc program possess a doctoral-level qualification with a strong emphasis on industry application, surpassing the conventional Doctor of Philosophy. By tackling real-world problems, their research enables them to make informed decisions that encompass technical expertise, business management, and opportunities, thereby contributing to the development of innovative solutions.

