  ('Master in Geotechnical Engineering', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UTM University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 4400, '1.5 years', '["Feb","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'Master of Geotechnical Engineering at Universiti Teknologi Malaysia The objective of this Master''s program is to enhance students'' knowledge by providing a comprehensive understanding of the engineering properties and behavior of geological materials, specifically soils and rocks. The program focuses on advancing knowledge in geotechnical analysis and design of common structures in Civil Engineering. Additionally, the program equips students with the skills necessary for further studies and research in relevant areas. The target audience for this program includes professionals and practicing engineers in the field of geotechnical engineering.

