  ('Master of Engineering', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UTM University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 4400, '1.5 years', '["Feb","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'Master of Engineering (Environment Management) at Universiti Teknologi Malaysia Our program offers a comprehensive and advanced curriculum in environmental technology and management. With a focus on addressing complex environmental issues, we provide students with the latest knowledge and skills in the field. Through courses covering topics such as environmental policy, pollution control, environmental management systems, and waste management, we strive to equip students with the necessary tools to tackle real-world environmental challenges.

The objectives of our program are multi-fold. Firstly, we aim to develop a deep understanding of the principles of environmental engineering among our students. This knowledge serves as a foundation for their future work in the field. Secondly, we emphasize the application of international standards in solving practical environmental problems, ensuring our graduates are well-prepared to meet global standards in their professional endeavors.

Furthermore, our program focuses on building essential skills, including the ability to plan, design, analyze, and implement environmental engineering projects. Effective communication and collaboration are also emphasized, enabling students to work effectively in teams and engage with stakeholders.

We understand the importance of adaptability and lifelong learning in a rapidly changing world. Thus, our program aims to cultivate independent learning skills and the ability to adapt to evolving environmental situations.

Lastly, we place a strong emphasis on professional ethics and integrity. We strive to instill in our students a sense of responsibility and ethical conduct, ensuring they make ethically sound decisions throughout their careers.', '[]'::jsonb, '{"min_gpa":"2.0","ielts":"5.5"}'::jsonb, '["Specialist in field"]'::jsonb, 'Fees Applies', 'A Bachelor’s Degree with good honours from Universiti Teknologi Malaysia or any other institution of higher learning recognised by the Senate.

For other qualifications and certificates (e.g., Other qualifications equivalent to a Bachelor’s degree , etc..) please contact our educational consultants or submit your application for Admission assessment.'),
  ('Master of Engineering (Mechatronics and Automatic Control)', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UTM University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 4400, '1.5 years', '["Feb","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The M.Eng. (Mechatronics and Automatic Control) program at Universiti Teknologi Malaysia focuses on the interdisciplinary field of Mechatronics and Control Engineering, which finds applications across various industrial sectors. This program aims to provide graduates with the necessary theoretical and practical skills to apply modern control techniques to industrial problems and engage in further research. The curriculum is designed in line with the requirements of Industry 4.0 and covers key aspects of control theory and mechatronics, including adaptive and robust control, artificial intelligence, process control, industrial instrumentation, robotics, and control applications in mechatronic systems. It also encompasses courses on Rapid Prototyping and Simulation, Smart Manufacturing, Cyber-Physical Systems, Embedded Systems for Innovative Product Design, Deep Learning, and Intelligent Vision Systems. Students will gain proficiency in utilizing computer packages for control design. The program can be completed in a minimum study duration of one year, requiring 43 credits. Exceptional students may have the opportunity to pursue Ph.D. research after completing this program.

For other qualifications and certificates (e.g., Other qualifications equivalent to a Bachelor’s degree , etc..) please contact our educational consultants or submit your application for Admission assessment.

Thank you  for submitting your form to us. We will contact you as soon as possible to assist you on your university journey.', '[]'::jsonb, '{"min_gpa":"2.0","ielts":"5.5"}'::jsonb, '["Specialist in field"]'::jsonb, 'Fees Applies', 'A Bachelor’s Degree with good honours from Universiti Teknologi Malaysia or any other institution of higher learning recognised by the Senate.

