  ('Master of Forensic Engineering - Online Degree', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UTM University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 6600, '1.5 years', '["Feb","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Master of Forensic Engineering at UTM University Malaysia, offered through Open and Distance Learning (ODL), is designed to provide advanced and in-depth knowledge in the field of forensic engineering. The program focuses on the investigation and analysis of failures in various engineering disciplines, including civil, electrical, mechanical, and chemical engineering.

