  ('Master of Forensic Science ( Sains Forensik)', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UTM University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 4400, '1.5 years', '["Feb","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Master of Forensic Science program at Universiti Teknologi Malaysia is a specialized program designed to provide comprehensive knowledge and practical skills in the field of forensic science. This program offers students the opportunity to develop a deep understanding of the scientific principles and techniques used in the investigation and analysis of crime scenes, evidence collection, and forensic laboratory analysis. Through a combination of theoretical coursework and hands-on practical training, students are equipped with the necessary skills to conduct forensic examinations, analyze complex evidence, and present their findings in legal settings.

