  ('Master of Forensics Engineering', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UTM University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 3410, '2 years', '["Feb","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Master of Forensic Engineering program at Universiti Teknologi Malaysia strives to integrate and generate advanced knowledge in the specialized areas of Forensic Engineering within professional practices. This program combines four key disciplines associated with the failure of structures and constructions in civil, electrical, mechanical, and chemical engineering. Students will receive guidance in identifying the root cause or causes of failures with the intention of enhancing the performance or lifespan of a component, as well as aiding courts in establishing the facts surrounding accidents.

