  ('Master of Language in Communication and Digital Culture - Online Degree', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UTM University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 6600, '1.5 years', '["Feb","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Master of Language in Communication and Digital Culture program at Universiti Teknologi Malaysia is a specialized Master''s program that centers around the study of language in communication, with a particular emphasis on the aspects of digital culture. This program delves into the intersection of language, communication, and the digital realm, exploring how language is used and impacted by digital technologies, media platforms, and online communication channels. By examining the evolving dynamics of digital culture, students in this program gain a deeper understanding of the role of language in shaping and mediating communication practices in the digital age. The Master of Language in Communication and Digital Culture program at Universiti Teknologi Malaysia provides students with the knowledge and skills to critically analyze and navigate the complexities of digital communication, preparing them for careers in fields such as media, public relations, marketing, and digital content creation.

