  ('Master of Philosophy Field of Research: Halal Science', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UTM University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 3124, '1.5 years', '["Feb","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Master of Philosophy (MPhil) program in the field of Halal Science at Universiti Teknologi Malaysia offers students the opportunity to undertake extensive and independent research under the guidance of experienced supervisors. This program focuses on achieving excellence in research by specializing in the field of Halal Science, with sub-fields including Halal Fiqh, Applied Halal, and Halal Management.

