  ('Master of Philosophy in Gas Engineering', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UTM University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 6490, '2 years', '["Feb","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Master of Philosophy in Gas Engineering program at Universiti Teknologi Malaysia is in high demand due to the growing need for skilled professionals to support various gas projects. These projects encompass gas liquefaction, gas processing, petrochemical processing, as well as the distribution of gas to power plants, industrial facilities, commercial centers, and residential consumers across peninsular Malaysia.

This program offers a distinctive blend of chemical process and gas engineering knowledge, enabling graduates to pursue careers as chemical and process engineers, as well as gas engineers specializing in transportation and gas utilization. With their expertise in gas engineering, graduates can find employment in a wide range of sectors, including petrochemical industries, oleochemical industries, manufacturing industries, government agencies, and private organizations.

Prominent companies such as PETRONAS, SHELL, EXXONMOBIL, the Energy Commission of Malaysia, Gas Malaysia Sdn Bhd, SIRIM, DOSH, NIOSH, consultant firms, and service industries provide potential career opportunities for our graduates. Moreover, graduates can also contribute to teaching and engage in research and development activities at higher learning institutions and research centers.

For other qualifications and certificates (e.g., Other qualifications equivalent to a Bachelor’s degree , etc..) please contact our educational consultants or submit your application for Admission assessment.

