  ('Master of Science (Engineering Business Management)', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UTM University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 4400, '1.5 years', '["Feb","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Master of Science in Engineering Business Management program at Universiti Teknologi Malaysia is a comprehensive and integrated program that combines crucial management and business skills with technology and operations knowledge. The program is designed to provide working professionals in engineering and other technical-based organizations with continuous education and the opportunity to enhance their engineering knowledge. With a strong focus on practical application, participants are equipped with the skills to make immediate contributions and add value to their employers and the industry as a whole. The program aims to prepare individuals for senior executive positions and management roles in engineering and other professional fields, while also fostering a lifelong learning mindset to adapt to evolving industry demands.

