  ('Master of Science', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UTM University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 3691, '1.5 years', '["Feb","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Master of Science in Engineering Design program at Universiti Teknologi Malaysia is aligned with the core value of "Creation of Lifelong Learning" by providing graduates with opportunities to enhance their knowledge in the field. This postgraduate program specifically caters to individuals with backgrounds in Bachelor of Engineering, Bachelor of Technology, and Bachelor of Science. The program focuses on strengthening knowledge in areas such as product design, mechanical systems, and electrical systems. Its primary objective is to produce expert graduates capable of developing innovative solutions for systems or products, taking into consideration the benefits to society and environmental preservation. By equipping students with advanced design skills and a holistic perspective, the program prepares them to contribute to sustainable development and address real-world challenges in engineering.

