  ('Master of Science (M.Sc) in Herbal Technology', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UTM University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 4400, '1.5 years', '["Feb","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Master of Science (M.Sc) in Herbal Technology at UTM University Malaysia is designed to capitalize on the rapid growth of the herbal industry, which presents unique investment opportunities The program is offered by the Institute of Bioproduct Development (IBD) and is a taught, modular-based master’s program focusing on the technological aspects of developing herbal-based products

