  ('Master of Science (M.Sc) in Polymer Technology', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UTM University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 4400, '1.5 years', '["Feb","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Master of Science (M.Sc) in Polymer Technology at UTM University Malaysia focuses on the rapidly evolving field of polymer science and technology, which significantly influences our daily lives The program provides a comprehensive understanding of polymer science with an emphasis on the properties of polymers relevant to industrial applications

