  ('Master of Science', (SELECT id FROM public.universities WHERE name = 'UTM University Malaysia' LIMIT 1), 'Master', 4400, '1.5 years', '["Feb","Sep"]'::jsonb, 'The Master of Science, Technology, and Innovation Policy (MSTIP) program at Universiti Teknologi Malaysia is a specialized postgraduate program that focuses on the areas of science, technology, and innovation policy. With a curriculum comprising core courses, electives, an internship project, and a compulsory university course, this program aims to equip academically qualified and well-trained policy makers with the necessary skills to develop effective and sustainable policies in the rapidly advancing technological landscape. By providing a dedicated platform for the study of science, technology, and innovation policy, MSTIP caters to the manpower needs of Malaysia and other countries, fostering the formulation of relevant and impactful policies that drive societal progress and sustainable development.

For other qualifications and certificates (e.g., Other qualifications equivalent to a Bachelor’s degree , etc..) please contact our educational consultants or submit your application for Admission assessment.

